<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>A type of parameter with an associated unit of measures that describes the behaviour of members of the category. 

Examples of category parameters are; 
for fuels combustion : GHG Yield (t CO2 eqv/ltr), CH4 Yield (t CH4/t), CO2 Yield (t CO2/t), N2O Yield (t N2O/t)
for NCI gas : WtWheel CI (g CO2 eqv/MJ)  </a:Comment>
