<a:Comment>A part of the market product that is regarded as a source of GHG emissions. Emission Components are defined for lifecycle parts such as product supply and product use and, for blended fuels by their constituent material types. Components are assigned to one emission category type which enables their emissions to be estimated from its factors.</a:Comment>
