<o:Table Id="o304">
<a:ObjectID>3D3DF1EF-B058-4E4A-9950-BE54724F244D</a:ObjectID>
<a:Name>NCI_CLIENT_PRODUCT_FACTOR</a:Name>
<a:Code>NCI_CLIENT_PRODUCT_FACTOR</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1762783496</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1762783498</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Maps the parameters of a client product type to corresponding IDs depending on the type of parameter.  Parameters can be of 2 types - Carbon Intensity and Property Conversion factor.
If parameter type is Carbon Intensity Factor, the field Activity_Type_Param_ID points to the corresponding CI factor. This can be then used to fetch the emission factors for the client product type
If parameter type is Conversing Factor, the field Property_Value_ID points to Product_Property_Value table. This is used to return the corresponding property value
</a:Comment>
<a:History>ORG {9D2BADF0-0EA1-4DE5-9F95-365DD09EB948}
DAT 1762783498</a:History>
<a:TotalSavingCurrency/>
