<a:Name>FUEL_PRODUCT_DEFAULT</a:Name>
<a:Code>FL_PRDCT_DFLT</a:Code>
<a:CreationDate>1762783496</a:CreationDate>
<a:Creator>Elton.Manoku</a:Creator>
<a:ModificationDate>1762783498</a:ModificationDate>
<a:Modifier>Elton.Manoku</a:Modifier>
<a:Comment>Contains default Emissions (product emisiosn group) for a combination of product, engine type, electricity subgrid and fuel application
The presence of a record indicates the combination of fuel_product_region_id and factor_group_id is a default for the product
The fields Fuel_product_Id, Engine_type_ID, Application_ID and Elect_Subgri_ID form a unique key. i.e. There should be only a single default for this combination.</a:Comment>
