<a:Comment>Fuel Consumption rate value for an equipment, using a fuel product in a region.
Fuel consumption values can be measured either as energy efficiency (distance travelled per unit of fuel e.g. mi/gal) or as energy consumption (fuel quantity required or a unit of distance e.g. ltr/100km)</a:Comment>
