<a:Comment>Section-wise comments given by approver on a request.
Section comments can belong to these categories -
1. General sections on the EFL UI. e.g. Extract Type, Parameter Value Set
2. Each product-region-factor selected for PCF products
3. Each factor selected for NCI products
4. Each factor selected for customised NCI solutions (CPM, Olympus)</a:Comment>
