<a:Comment>Intended uses which the client intends to use the PCF factor for. The client can select intended uses out of the list of approved intended uses for the product, or can provide their own custom text.
This table holds and tracks the client requested information as it goes through approval workflow. Once approved, the record is copied from this table to corresponding table in database.
</a:Comment>
